GM4+(3) [FM, dipole]     x          P4/mm'm' (123.345)  III   4/mm'm'  along x            ferromagnet
GM4+(3) [FM, dipole]     y          P4/mm'm' (123.345)  III   4/mm'm'  along y            ferromagnet
GM4+(3) [FM, dipole]     111        R-3m' (166.101)     III   -3m'     along [111]        ferromagnet
GM4+(3) [AFM, octupole]  z          P4/mm'm' (123.345)  III   4/mm'm'  along z            compensated (unrelated sublattices)
GM4+(3) [AFM, octupole]  x          P4/mm'm' (123.345)  III   4/mm'm'  along x            compensated (unrelated sublattices)
GM4+(3) [AFM, octupole]  y          P4/mm'm' (123.345)  III   4/mm'm'  along y            compensated (unrelated sublattices)
GM4+(3) [AFM, octupole]  111        R-3m' (166.101)     III   -3m'     along [11-1]       noncollinear
GM5+(3) [AFM, octupole]  z          P4'/mm'm (123.342)  III   4'/mm'm  none               altermagnet (d-wave)
GM5+(3) [AFM, octupole]  x          P4'/mm'm (123.342)  III   4'/mm'm  none               altermagnet (d-wave)
GM5+(3) [AFM, octupole]  y          P4'/mm'm (123.342)  III   4'/mm'm  none               altermagnet (d-wave)
GM5+(3) [AFM, octupole]  111        R-3m (166.97)       I     -3m      none               noncollinear

MSG: magnetic space group from the moment directions (BNS number, type I-IV);
MPG: magnetic point group; net magnetization: the direction allowed by symmetry;
class: from the signs of the moments along their common axis only (nonrelativistic).
MSG and MPG symbols are in the standard BNS setting; directions are in the Cartesian axes of the input cell.

* Output files *
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM4+_dipole_z.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM4+_dipole_x.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM4+_dipole_y.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM4+_dipole_111.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM4+_octupole_z.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM4+_octupole_x.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM4+_octupole_y.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM4+_octupole_111.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM5+_octupole_z.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM5+_octupole_x.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM5+_octupole_y.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_GM5+_octupole_111.vesta

All AFM bases satisfy sum_i S_i = 0; FM entries carry the cluster dipole moment.
Reference: M.-T. Suzuki et al., PRB 95, 094406 (2017); PRB 99, 174407 (2019).
Reference (collinear classes): L. Smejkal, J. Sinova and T. Jungwirth, Phys. Rev. X 12, 031042 (2022).







