M3-(1) [AFM (q != 0)]  comp1      P_C4/nmm (129.421)  IV    4/mmm1'  none               noncollinear
M5+(2) [AFM (q != 0)]  x          C_amma (67.509)     IV    mmm1'    none               antiferromagnet (T tau)
M5+(2) [AFM (q != 0)]  y          C_amma (67.509)     IV    mmm1'    none               antiferromagnet (T tau)
M5-(2) [AFM (q != 0)]  z          C_ammm (65.489)     IV    mmm1'    none               antiferromagnet (T tau)
M5-(2) [AFM (q != 0)]  z_2        C_ammm (65.489)     IV    mmm1'    none               antiferromagnet (T tau)
M2+(1) [AFM (q != 0)]  z          P_C4/mbm (127.397)  IV    4/mmm1'  none               antiferromagnet (T tau)
