M4-(1) [AFM (q != 0)]  comp1      P_C4/nbm (125.373)  IV    4/mmm1'  none               noncollinear

MSG: magnetic space group from the moment directions (BNS number, type I-IV);
MPG: magnetic point group; net magnetization: the direction allowed by symmetry;
class: from the signs of the moments along their common axis only (nonrelativistic).
MSG and MPG symbols are in the standard BNS setting; directions are in the Cartesian axes of the input cell.
component: the tag of the listing and of the VESTA file name (comp<N>: the N-th basis vector of its space).

* Output files *
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M1-_M_comp1.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M3-_M_comp1.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M5+_M_x.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M5+_M_y.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M5-_M_z.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M5-_M_z_2.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M2+_M_z.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M2-_M_comp1.vesta
  Spin basis written to: POSCAR_AlNi3_spin_M4-_M_comp1.vesta

Reference: M.-T. Suzuki et al., PRB 95, 094406 (2017); PRB 99, 174407 (2019).
Reference (collinear classes): L. Smejkal, J. Sinova and T. Jungwirth, Phys. Rev. X 12, 031042 (2022).
